Package: fastrcmdcheck
Title: Fast, Parallel, Cache-Aware 'R CMD check' for CI
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Grant",
        family = "Neilson",
        email = "grant@cosyne.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    ),
    person(
        given = "Gregor",
        family = "Lueg",
        role = "ctb"
    )
  )
Description: A drop-in, substantially faster alternative to 'rcmdcheck' for
    continuous integration. The package is compiled exactly once (in
    parallel, through 'ccache' / 'sccache' and with a persistent 'cargo'
    target directory for Rust code), and the static 'R CMD check' checks,
    unit tests, examples and vignettes then run concurrently against that
    single installation.
URL: https://github.com/grantn5/fastrcmdcheck
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
